{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1258169-bloodstained-brood-official-beast-ready-made-pcs-fan-fix","id":1258169,"title":"Bloodstained Brood - Official Beast Ready-Made PCs fan fix","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-30T03:11:03-07:00","id":1258169,"title":"Bloodstained Brood - Official Beast Ready-Made PCs fan fix","content":"I run yesterday Bloodstained Brood with my own story and we found that characters do not have their Traits. Were Lair Traits added to character sheets, finally? Re-download PDF from DriveThru, but version on it do not fix it.<br /> <br /> If PDF was not fixed in some version - <b>Maybe you have idea for what Lair Traits for PCs should be?</b> I will ponder on it in free time. As it's fan made fix of PCs, Traits from <b>Beast Players Guide</b> are totally fine to use.<br /> <br /> As it is fan fix topic - We can remake also Annika character when 2E <b>Changeling</b> will have official Snowskin Kith. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-30-2018, 11:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T07:52:32-07:00","id":1258202,"title":"","content":"Just going throw this out there, but the lack of Lair Traits may have been a feature, not a bug. By all means, brainstorm away, but there doesn't have to be a correct answer. <br /> <br /> Defintely update that Changeling though!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T13:03:32-07:00","id":1258253,"title":"","content":"List of all Beasts in <i>Bloodstained Brood</i>. Choose three Traits, as PDF shows that characters can have up to Lair 2 ratings. First two Traits are defaults. I will edit this post with more ideas later.<br /> <br /> <b>Neil C. Walker III - Ice Creature</b><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018Neil\u2019s Lair twists in a perverted winter wonderland, shards of ice almost like glass, dripping with the blood of former victims. It trails down the side of an icy cliff, leaking through the Chambers of his broodmates and mingling with blood they\u2019ve spilled for themselves.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene - Extreme Cold, Mirrored, Blizzard<br /> <br /> <b>Ryan Gallagher - Rotting Debris</b><br /> <br /> <b>Maia Graham - Oily Sea Monster</b><br /> <br /> <b>Hannah Short - Scalpel-Finger</b><br /> <br /> <b>Malik Turner - Edged Shadow</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T08:44:11-07:00","id":1258398,"title":"","content":"Personally, I'd use Jagged instead of Mirrored for Neil's Lair Traits. <br /> <br /> Very useful thread, by the way! I'll keep it handy for future reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T01:13:28-07:00","id":1263033,"title":"","content":"Now version of the Bloodstained Brood traits list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Neil C. Walker III - Ice Creature</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018Neil\u2019s Lair twists in a perverted winter wonderland, shards of ice almost like glass, dripping with the blood of former victims. It trails down the side of an icy cliff, leaking through the Chambers of his broodmates and mingling with blood they\u2019ve spilled for themselves.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene - Extreme Cold, Jagged, Blizzard<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Ryan Gallagher - Rotting Debris</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018Ryan\u2019s Horror is a shadow formed mass of crumbled soot and dirt that rots everything in its presence. His Lair is dark</i> <i>and grim, filled with flowers that decompose with proximity to any life. The blood that now seeps from the ground (courtesy of the connection to Neil\u2019s Lair) is too anemic to contribute.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene - Stinging, Stench, Rotting<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Maia Graham - Oily Sea Monster</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018(Maia\u2019s) Lair is a deep pit of water, with dim light streaming down into the depths, playing tricks on the eyes and casting odd shadows. Since joining the brood, rivulets of blood trickle </i><br /> <i>into the water as well.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene \u2013 Poor Light, Flooded, Bad Angles<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Hannah Short - Scalpel-Finger</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018Hannah\u2019s Horror is a lanky, hairless creature with scalpels on the edge of spindly fingers. Skin clings like rubber to its body, and droops from bones at the face and a long, thin neck. Her </i><br /> <i>Lair smells of formaldehyde, and the chamber is dark, with a floor made of eyes of varying size and color.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene - Thin Air, Darkness, Mirrored<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Malik Turner - Edged Shadow</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Lair:</b> <i>\u2018Malik\u2019s Lair is a completely empty, concrete scape that reflects all sound, making it easy for him to swoop down and attack.\u2019</i><br /> <br /> <b>Lair\u2019s Traits </b>- 1/Scene - Echoing, Darkness, Bottomless","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-27T11:16:03-07:00","id":1263099,"title":"","content":"Wouldn't bottomless mean victims can't do anything but fall?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}